These routers were ranked based on their compatibility with intricate woodworking, variable speed control, and power output, with the Makita RT0701C Compact Router being the top recommendation due to its smaller size, ergonomic body, and powerful motor. The Bosch MRF23EVS 2.3 HP Fixed-Base Router and The WEN 15-Amp Variable Speed Plunge Router were also highly ranked for their versatility and 1/4 and 1/2-inch bit compatibility. The SKIL 10 Amp Fixed Base Router and RIDGID 1-1/2 HP Compact Router were included due to their efficient features and reliability for detailed routing tasks.

Although the Axiom Overhead Dust System and Rockwell 10pc T-Shank Blade Set are useful accessories for a wood router, they were not included as direct product recommendations for your woodworking needs.
